{"unit_id":"tenebris173__dsh-skin-prts#card-zh","repo":"tenebris173/dsh-skin-prts","commit":"defc176010924690ec83aa2e5db13708ba81bd58","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"PRTS 是一款面向 DSH Web 界面的罗德岛终端风格皮肤，可在纸面亮色与作战终端暗色之间切换。它通过主题 token 覆盖和样式注入改变界面外观，并提供强调色、圆角、纹理、硬投影和字体选项。皮肤可由加载器托管，也能在加载器缺席时进入自立模式。适合希望自定义 DSH 视觉风格的用户；偏好保存在本地浏览器，无需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:862-928","lib/client.js:1173-1233"]}
{"unit_id":"tenebris173__dsh-skin-prts#card-en","repo":"tenebris173/dsh-skin-prts","commit":"defc176010924690ec83aa2e5db13708ba81bd58","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"PRTS gives the DSH web interface a Rhodes Island terminal look, with light paper and dark themes. Users can adjust accent color, corners, texture, shadows, and font. It registers with a skin loader or runs standalone. Preferences stay in browser storage; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:862-928","lib/client.js:1173-1233"]}
