{"unit_id":"tenebris173__dsh-skin-prts#feature-theme","repo":"tenebris173/dsh-skin-prts","commit":"defc176010924690ec83aa2e5db13708ba81bd58","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"PRTS 的功能「皮肤主题切换」：PRTS 提供纸面亮色和终端暗色两套外观，并可选择跟随应用或系统主题。激活时覆盖宿主主题 token，主题变化时重算样式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:20-36","lib/client.js:862-928"]}
{"unit_id":"tenebris173__dsh-skin-prts#feature-settings","repo":"tenebris173/dsh-skin-prts","commit":"defc176010924690ec83aa2e5db13708ba81bd58","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"PRTS 的功能「外观调节」：PRTS 的设置面板可调整强调色、圆角、纹理、硬投影和 DIN 字体等外观选项；修改后立即应用，并将偏好保存在浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:472-502","lib/client.js:528-540"]}
{"unit_id":"tenebris173__dsh-skin-prts#feature-mode","repo":"tenebris173/dsh-skin-prts","commit":"defc176010924690ec83aa2e5db13708ba81bd58","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"PRTS 的功能「加载器托管或自立」：PRTS 等待 uiSkinLoader 服务并登记皮肤；若加载器未出现，则在宽限期后注册自己的设置入口并应用皮肤。用户可通过皮肤接口激活或停用外观。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1173-1255"]}
{"unit_id":"tenebris173__dsh-skin-prts#feature-ornament","repo":"tenebris173/dsh-skin-prts","commit":"defc176010924690ec83aa2e5db13708ba81bd58","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"PRTS 的功能「界面装饰」：启用皮肤时，PRTS 添加全屏网格、扫描线和四角标记装饰节点；停用时移除这些节点及关联样式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:506-524","lib/client.js:924-987"]}
